<title>SPAIN: Spain ICO to issue three year callable pta bond.</title>
<headline>Spain ICO to issue three year callable pta bond.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish official credit agency Instituto de Credito Oficial (ICO) gave Dresdner Bank the mandate to issue between 15 and 20 billion pta in three year bond, Dresdner Bank Madrid ag, sucursal Espana said.</p>
<p>The domestic bond on which the CNMV authorization is still pending, has a 6.7 pct coupon and a call after the first year.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
